# Git Push Safety

This project is deployed via GitHub Pages with a custom domain (shuangli.design).

## Critical Files

- `CNAME` — required for the custom domain. **Never delete or omit this file.**

## Rules

- **Never force push** unless absolutely necessary. If the local repo has diverged from remote, pull and merge first.
- Before any push, verify `CNAME` exists and contains `shuangli.design`.
- Before force pushing, always check for remote-only files (e.g. `git fetch && git diff origin/main --name-only`) and preserve them locally first.
- After pushing, verify GitHub Pages build status with `gh api repos/shuang-and-elfo/portfolio/pages`.
